# Build context of infra/docker/Dockerfile: sources only. Dependencies and build outputs are made inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
.git
.github
.gstack
.claude
.seed-demo.json
tooling/loadtest/data
tooling/loadtest/results
# Secrets anywhere in the tree (patterns here are anchored at the root, unlike .gitignore), and backup.sh's
# default target, which holds the database dump and every secret.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
infra/production/backups
infra/production/.upgrade-previous
docs
**/dist-bundle
# The public site has its own build (website.yml); the image never uses it.
website
